WEBVTT

25:30.388 --> 25:32.682
(WIND WHISTLING)

25:42.692 --> 25:44.778
Hello.

25:46.196 --> 25:48.865
Ser Alliser said I'm to be
your new watch partner.

25:50.826 --> 25:53.161
I should warn you,

25:53.286 --> 25:55.664
I don't see all that well.

25:57.124 --> 25:58.667
Come stand by the fire.

25:59.876 --> 26:01.920
- It's warmer.
- No, that's all right. I'm fine.
